{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:30:54Z","created_by_operation":"op_25edd85f34a34b6cb582e168baf6ec2f","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_0d36ab97baa7d137fc6cf2dd0f41cf1aef121c5cd38d17470636a0088f42aff5","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"aiwaves-cn/agents@e8c4e3c2d197 snapshot e1eef48ba43f73dd","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_761d0e98d86b70c35f865a8d87c36968696cdab58f17a0455a6f628c5e79c22f"],"source_ids":["src_4c717d08875e5bc78046f74c980636be"],"text":"Agent symbolic learning analogizes an agent pipeline to a neural net's computational graph, with prompts and tools playing the role of layer weights.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:30:54Z","updated_by_operation":"op_25edd85f34a34b6cb582e168baf6ec2f"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:30:54Z","created_by_operation":"op_25edd85f34a34b6cb582e168baf6ec2f","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_10d38630123cb9ea5b3e2677a0704e49280dd570e1b9cf9ce24b1c567486d1f7","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"aiwaves-cn/agents@e8c4e3c2d197 snapshot e1eef48ba43f73dd","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_41070abca667c6ac0c3f71357c3dd3455e5cb4cb4fbd564f4d394ba03e4d165b"],"source_ids":["src_4c717d08875e5bc78046f74c980636be"],"text":"Training implements a forward pass (agent execution) recording inputs, outputs, prompts, and tool usage per node in a trajectory, then a prompt-based loss producing a language loss.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:30:54Z","updated_by_operation":"op_25edd85f34a34b6cb582e168baf6ec2f"}
